# Purpose/owner: test-only repositoryfixture.New/NewUnbootstrapped setup policy reference.
# Type/units: one canonical absolute path to a complete JSON document; budgets inside are integer seconds.
# Optional: an UNSET variable preserves setup30s and MySQL lock1/step5/total20/cleanup2s exactly.
# An explicitly empty reference is invalid. All JSON fields are required; unknown/duplicate/null/aliases fail.
# Bounds: format_version=1; setup30..900s; MySQL lock1..60, step1..300, cleanup1..30s;
# total >= lock_wait + step and <=1800s; setup >= total + cleanup + lock_wait (setup cap900s also applies).
# Protected handling: install the actual file0600, same UID, single link, canonical private0700 parent.
# The sample is secret-free; it contains no DSN/password, business deadline, skip switch or target override.
# Precedence/mapping: this sole explicit TEST reference replaces canonical setup defaults; production
# mysql_migrations policy and every business/cancellation/claim timeout remain unchanged. No YAML override.
# Effect: loaded once before each new fixture allocates DB work; not reloaded during its business calls.
# A new policy needs a newly frozen source/test artifact and admitted harness; no mutation replay.
PROJECT_ONE_TEST_REPOSITORY_SETUP_FILE=/absolute/private/repository-setup.json
